{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"6202f9cccf90a75c7b7e296fbdcb8e37eac3c8ba46ffdc0be25b650f50edbfb7","ja":"なるになりきって","zh":"彻底融入角色","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c8b13334f527e27b767d8dc33f8d220882ee8e2524f1689cb588c31767dc265f","ja":"あっ、美也、ここにおったんか！","zh":"啊，美也，你在这里啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d94da3419f61d9e6b3aa2697f3baff3bf751242edb004d4862fa7ed60b55f763","ja":"さっきのSNSって、なんやったん？\nほら、この投稿！","zh":"刚才那条社交动态是怎么回事啊？\n你看，就这篇投稿！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bb4fa9f5522b263fd19011ad5ba0ab914f36e070a94a46a09bd4c49945516025","ja":"「おはよう。今日は一日レッスンの予定。\n演技力以外も、もっと鍛えなきゃ」","zh":"「早上好。今天预定整天都要练习。\n除了演技，其他方面也得更加磨炼才行」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"94e5f1fae9062cbbcc1cf866329e349c3c120cdefe8a1ab73ab84f291fd747c5","ja":"いつもの美也とは違うっちゅうか、\nなんや……ちょっと、なるっぽくない？","zh":"和平时的美也有些不一样，\n或者说……感觉有点像鸣？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"35f1312509a72edc41f203f457298e4a2b164b358cb5b9e4247620737839e268","ja":"ふふふっ、さすが奈緒ちゃんですな～。","zh":"呵呵呵，真不愧是奈绪呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"24cdd9d03099a8ea8813c07ac373aacc1c82822931f1355be1742dfd4fd0b826","ja":"その通り、これは\nなるになりきって書いたんですよ～♪","zh":"没错，这是\n代入鸣的心情写出来的哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f8a07df94b2a01dfc9ebea43592ba108b604764c8c35834942ec3906064f3738","ja":"やっぱり！　でも、なんでまた？","zh":"果然！不过，怎么会突然这样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d556f9e24ba448eef993e0a3933d2e46574cd8288705463a6ee9fd38d2606073","ja":"それはですね～、\nこちらの投稿がきっかけでして～。","zh":"那个嘛～，\n是因为收到了这条投稿～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4544b5e64c9e49a1becbca31a7f2e9269192df610bec3b7fe1150ea572c388df","ja":"「『STARDOM ROAD』第五幕の美也ちゃん\n普段と全然違うキャラでビックリした」","zh":"“《STARDOM ROAD》第五幕里的美也\n角色和平时完全不一样，吓了我一跳”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3ba14e4f45315cfc5bd808f1f35cc11983d0a7307c778ee963ca5fe9992d90f0","ja":"「第五幕のなるちゃん、個人的にすごくツボ……。\n美也さま、これから推します」","zh":"「第五幕的成美，个人觉得超戳我……。\n美也大人，今后我要推你了」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6bdcaa6298c0ebe063f4286fd31058e42de957343be3fd0e672a1926a4a4490b","ja":"へえ～！　美也のなる、めっちゃ好評やん！","zh":"哎～！美也演的鸣，评价超级好呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"062585ab2c8acec2350c983e311217e8a3d1171a491d2e957f421bbe2929d297","ja":"はい～。ありがたいことに、\nファンのみなさんに、気に入ってもらえたみたいで～♪","zh":"是的～托大家的福，\n粉丝们似乎都很喜欢的样子～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2dde9de323a746d413848a4f893b0317f542c25774b8e0c06ec1ba3ec3f61ec6","ja":"なので、今日だけ特別に、なるになりきって、\nSNSに投稿してみようと思ったんですよ～。","zh":"所以我想着，就今天破例一次彻底变成奈留，\n在社交平台上发条动态试试看呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1c5f3bf0b5efb664232f168648bf711a37ba25258f39b6c24fb438a922f7d4ca","ja":"なるほど、特別サービスってわけやな。\nええやん、おもろそう！","zh":"原来如此，算是特别优待啊。\n挺好嘛，感觉很有意思！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8f892debbe700c5055448e4c7e69f5e230f4030a2cfede2b8e8e7f34d59a650c","ja":"そんならいっそ、私ら全員を役に置き換えて\n投稿したら、もっと喜んでもらえるんちゃう？","zh":"既然这样，干脆把我们所有人都替换成角色\n发上去的话，会不会让大家更开心啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6fe5d799542c7a13caaf47fdd31e9f49beefe4b19ca8ea446b43cbca4cb70234","ja":"つまり、『STARDOM ROAD』を観た人は\nさらに楽しめるわけですな？　素敵ですね～♪","zh":"也就是说，看过《STARDOM ROAD》的人\n能体会到更多乐趣是吧？真棒呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1472.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3e9a0548217330ebaefdd037d4593bf50d25b9615cd47db6eaf8b2f364905c05","ja":"もちろん、私も手伝わせてもらうで！\nこんなおもろそうなこと、乗らない手はないもんな♪","zh":"当然，我也会来帮忙的！\n这么有趣的事，哪有不掺一脚的道理嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
